+ ItemDisplay[(RARE OR CRAFT) !GEMMED !STAT218>0 (((rin OR HELM) ((MINDMG>0 CLVL<80) OR MINDMG>6) ((MAXDMG>0 CLVL<80) OR MAXDMG>6 OR (LOWLVL_MAXDMG_TAG MAXDMG>0))) OR ((CIRC OR SHIELD OR amu) LOWLVL_MINDMG_TAG LOWLVL_MAXDMG_TAG MINDMG>0 MAXDMG>0) OR ((WEAPON !STAFF !WAND !SOR) MINDMG>0 MAXDMG>0))]:%WHITE%%MINDMG%%TAN%min%CS%%NAME%{%NAME%}%CONTINUE%
@ 300-affix-tags.filter:953  Corr's convention (rare max damage off): the joined min-max damage tag shows the minimum alone (2026-10-28)
- ItemDisplay[WEAPON !STAFF !WAND !SOR (RARE OR CRAFT) !GEMMED MINDMG>0 STAT218>0]:%WHITE%%MINDMG%-$f(STAT22+FLOOR(STAT218*CLVL/8))%TAN%dmg%CS%%NAME%{%NAME%}%CONTINUE%
+ ItemDisplay[WEAPON !STAFF !WAND !SOR (RARE OR CRAFT) !GEMMED MINDMG>0 STAT218>0]:%WHITE%%MINDMG%%TAN%min%CS%%NAME%{%NAME%}%CONTINUE%

